  "priorExpiration": "2017-01-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1102.01 “Attending practitioner” means “attending practitioner” as defined in RSA 318:1, XXV, namely, “the physician or advanced practice registered nurse who has the primary responsibility for the treatment and care of the patient” and as outlined in the collaborative agreement.\n\nSource. #9381, eff 1-31-09, EXPIRED: 1-31-17\n\nNew. #12464, eff 1-23-18",
